msgid "The JAE (Japan Aviation Electronics Industry) JRE-30 radar is a light weight (110g) radar with a maximum range of over 50m.  The relatively wide beam width (about 20 deg) and reliable ranging even in difficult environments can make it a better choice than lidar for some applications."
